        text: "Ella took the night train to the coast because the morning tickets were too expensive. She shared a small compartment with a woman who worked as a nurse and a student who talked for hours about football. Ella couldn't sleep, but she didn't mind. The train arrived at five in the morning, before the sun came up. She walked out of the station, smelled the sea and knew the trip was worth it.",
